EQDeeps

== Reference data & fixtures ==

Portions of the test fixture data (real EverQuest log lines and their expected
parse results, under tests/EQDeeps.Core.Tests/Fixtures/) are derived from the
parser unit tests of EQLogParser (https://github.com/kauffman12/EQLogParser),
Copyright kauffman12, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Log lines themselves are EverQuest game output.

No source code from EQLogParser has been ported; EQDeeps is a clean-room
implementation. Behavior fidelity comes from documented grammars and the
fixture corpus above.

